# Agent Conversation Language

Talk to the user in **{{AGENT_LANGUAGE_POLICY}}**, reason in **{{AGENT_LANGUAGE_POLICY}}**, and write prompts for subagents in **{{AGENT_LANGUAGE_POLICY}}**. This holds in every project, skill and agent.
Write code comments in **{{AGENT_LANGUAGE_POLICY}}** unless a project rule sets another language.
Text that is written through a tool call and kept (commit messages, PR and issue bodies, file contents) follows the artifact-language rule of the project, not this file.
A project language rule covers only the output it names. The conversation stays in **{{AGENT_LANGUAGE_POLICY}}**.
